      (P * constQFactorPS 1 N) (2 * B) (by nlinarith) hP1 z hz k N
  calc
    ‖(P * section83JTPTripleFactorPS z N).coeff k‖ =
        ‖(((P * constQFactorPS 1 N) * constQFactorPS z N) *
          constQFactorPS z⁻¹ N).coeff k‖ := by
